      "latency_ru_sec": 0.302
    },
    {
      "id": "zh_028",
      "lang": "zh",
      "source_text": "因為!是佩隆希希啊!",
      "nllb_en": "And the Lord said to him, \"O Lord, I am the Lord your God.",
