      "latency_ru_sec": 0.4041
    },
    {
      "id": "zh_034",
      "lang": "zh",
      "source_text": "雖然之後會給予進入深度五的許可,但現在不行",
      "nllb_en": "Although they will be allowed to enter the deep five later, they are not now.",
