      "latency_ru_sec": 0.8516
    },
    {
      "id": "zh_045",
      "lang": "zh",
      "source_text": "佩隆是我們奥澤利亞王國北部邊境的領地。",
      "nllb_en": "Pelon is the northern border of the Kingdom of Osralia.",
